@startuml
title Use Case Diagram - Aurora SaaS Platform
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 220
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F8FBFF
  BorderColor #1F4E79
}

actor "System Admin" as SystemAdmin
actor "Tenant Admin" as TenantAdmin
actor "Staff / Operator" as Staff
actor "OSRM / VROOM" as Optimizer <<external system>>

rectangle "Aurora Platform" {
  package "Platform Administration" {
    usecase "Create / view / change\ntenant status" as UC_Tenant
    usecase "Ingest regulatory source\nand knowledge document" as UC_Ingest
  }

  package "Tenant Administration" {
    usecase "Invite and manage staff" as UC_Users
    usecase "Assign role and\nmanage permissions" as UC_Permissions
    usecase "Configure AI feature\nand route rules" as UC_Config
  }

  package "Logistics Operations" {
    usecase "Create, update, submit\nand cancel shipment" as UC_Shipment
    usecase "Manage cargo, locations,\ndocuments and milestones" as UC_ShipmentDetails
    usecase "Create, update and\nview route" as UC_Route
    usecase "Optimize route (VRP)" as UC_Optimize
    usecase "Request route\nrecommendation" as UC_Recommend
    usecase "Approve or reject\nroute" as UC_Approval
  }

  package "Financial and Compliance" {
    usecase "Estimate transport cost\nand customs duty" as UC_Financial
    usecase "Generate, create, view\nand update invoice" as UC_Invoice
    usecase "Check route compliance\nand ask compliance copilot" as UC_Compliance
  }
}

SystemAdmin --> UC_Tenant
SystemAdmin --> UC_Ingest

TenantAdmin --> UC_Users
TenantAdmin --> UC_Permissions
TenantAdmin --> UC_Config

Staff --> UC_Shipment
Staff --> UC_ShipmentDetails
Staff --> UC_Route
Staff --> UC_Optimize
Staff --> UC_Recommend
Staff --> UC_Approval
Staff --> UC_Financial
Staff --> UC_Invoice
Staff --> UC_Compliance

UC_Shipment .> UC_ShipmentDetails : <<include>>
UC_Optimize .> UC_Route : <<extend>>
UC_Recommend .> UC_Route : <<extend>>
UC_Approval .> UC_Route : <<extend>>
UC_Optimize --> Optimizer

note bottom of UC_Optimize
  Route Planning implements VRP optimization.
  OSRM supplies road routing / matrices;
  VROOM computes optimized route solutions.
end note

note bottom of UC_Compliance
  Based on ComplianceController and
  compliance_rag.proto: CheckRouteCompliance.
end note

@enduml
